WEBVTT

video-title-observation-reflex
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.870
Kuyang'ana maso ndi kuwala kobwerera kuchokera kumbuyo kwa diso

observation-01
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.200
Yambani posamba m'manja.

observation-02
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:14.000
Yang'anani dera lozungulira maso, zikope ndi maso. Lembani chilichonse chachilendo.

observation-03
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.400
Konzani Arclight. Sankhani kuwala kwamphamvu kwambiri ndipo kwezani zonyamulira magalasi zonse mpaka pamwamba. Gwiritsani ntchito chipinda chabata cha kuwala kochepa.

observation-04a
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Ikani bowo loyang'aniramo pafupi ndi diso lanu.

observation-04b
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Musaunikire kuwala m'diso lanu.

observation-04c
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.500
Musagwire Arclight cham'mbali.

observation-05
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:49.100
Muli patali utali wa mkono, pemphani wodwalayo kuti ayang'ane kuwala ndipo yang'anani maso onse awiri pamodzi.

observation-06
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:55.200
Kuwala kobwerera kufanane pa mphamvu ndi mtundu wake. Kusiyana pakati pa maso n'kwachilendo.

video-title-positioning
00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:56.857
Mmene mungaime ndi njira yoyandikirira diso

positioning-01
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:08.300
Pemphani wodwala kuti ayang'ane chinthu chakutali. Asakuyang'aneni kapena kuyang'ana kuwalako.

positioning-02
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:21.200
Gwiritsani ntchito dzanja ndi diso lanu lakumanja pa diso lakumanja la wodwala. Gwiritsani a kumanzere pa diso lake lakumanzere.

positioning-03
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:34.400
Imani mapazi pafupi ndi wodwala ndipo pendekerani kumbuyo. Pezani kuwala kobwerera kumbuyo kwa diso. Kutsatirani molunjika, madigiri khumi mpaka khumi ndi asanu ku mbali ya khutu kuchokera pa mwana wa diso.

positioning-04
00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:43.400
Mukayandikira, mudzaona disiki ya mtsempha wa kuona. Yandikiraninso kuti muone malo aakulu komanso chithunzi chisagwedezeke.

positioning-05
00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:53.200
Sungani Arclight molingana ndi diso la wodwala. Musaisunthe mmwamba kapena pansi. Disikiyo ikasowa, tsatirani mtsempha waukulu kubwerera kumeneko.

video-title-features
00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:58.685
Zinthu zoti muyang'ane

features-01
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Pa disiki ya mtsempha wa kuona, fotokozani ngati m'mphepete mwake mukuoneka bwino.

features-02
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:13.500
Fotokozani mtundu wa mphete ya minofu ndi chiŵerengero cha mulifupi mwa dzenje la pakati ndi disiki yonse.

features-03
00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:24.620
Disiki yabwinobwino ili ndi m'mphepete mooneka bwino ndi mphete ya minofu. Tumizani wodwala ngati pali kutupa, mtundu wotuwa kapena dzenje lalikulu kuposa mwachibadwa.

video-title-examination
00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:25.078
Mmene mungayezere

examine-01
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:33.700
Musanayang'ane fovea, kulitsani mwana wa diso. Popanda kutero, kuyang'ana kuwala kumachepetsa mwana wa diso ndipo kumbuyo kwake sikuoneka bwino.

examine-02
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Yambani pa disiki ya mtsempha wa kuona.

examine-03
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:56.400
Tsatirani nthambi zinayi zazikulu za mitsempha ya retina. Yambani pa disiki, tsatirani nthambi imodzi, bwererani pa disiki, kenako tsatirani yotsatira. Chitani zimenezi pa nthambi zonse zinayi.

examine-04
00:02:56.600 --> 00:03:03.050
Malizani pa macula ndi fovea, kenako bwerezani kuyeza diso linalo.
